{
  "fixture": "loading-schedule",
  "version": 1,
  "format": {
    "planDashboardLoads": "planDashboardLoads({now, constants, hostSourceId, closed, visibleStartedAt, sourceRows, widgets}) -> {start, nextWakeAt}. Times are ms. widgets are in layout order (top to bottom, left to right), each {id, sourceId, visible, state, firstData} with state idle | loading | suspended | done. start lists the widget ids to start now, in start order; nextWakeAt is when to plan again without a report, or null.",
    "rules": [
      "1. closed starts nothing and plans no wake.",
      "2. Busy sources are the distinct sourceId of loading widgets, hostSourceId excluded. Free slots = maxConcurrentSources minus the busy sources (never below 0). suspended and done widgets hold no slot.",
      "3. Candidates are the idle widgets and the suspended widgets that are visible. Visible candidates come first, then the others, each group in layout order.",
      "4. A candidate whose source is the host or is busy (also busy since earlier in this pass) starts at once and takes no slot.",
      "5. Any other candidate starts only while a slot is free, and takes it.",
      "6. A candidate that is not visible starts only when every visible widget has firstData or is done (true when no widget is visible), or when now - visibleStartedAt >= deferredStartTimeoutMs; and only while the sum of sourceRows is at most rowBudget. When visibleStartedAt is null and this pass starts a visible widget, the timeout counts from now.",
      "7. nextWakeAt is visibleStartedAt + deferredStartTimeoutMs when a candidate that is not visible is held back by the timing of rule 6 alone (the row budget allows it, and its source is the host, is busy or would get a free slot); otherwise null."
    ],
    "constants": "Equal to tokens.json loading. A runner passes them as input.constants of every case and step.",
    "cases": "{name, input, expected}: planDashboardLoads({...input, constants}) must equal expected.",
    "sequences": "{name, input, steps}: the state starts as input. For each step in order: set now to step.now; merge every step.set patch into the widget with that id (visible, state, firstData); set closed when the step has it; planDashboardLoads({...state, constants}) must equal step.expected; then every started widget becomes loading and, when visibleStartedAt is null and a started widget is visible, visibleStartedAt becomes now. After that the busy sources (rule 2), sorted, must equal step.busySources, and there are never more than maxConcurrentSources of them."
  },
  "constants": { "maxConcurrentSources": 2, "deferredStartTimeoutMs": 10000, "rowBudget": 10000, "sourceIdleReleaseMs": 60000 },
  "cases": [
    {
